.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kEo6WgXha-AQ7kNvwFE_VZ5&_nc_oc=AdluKxpNCgsXquMyoFHEQ_HLHmHV6WAApHzF8aOh0KtM8Fjom9J2h67Km3qbfS7_xec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwS5bXCNR9Bv7eDqkQULCEjhqEndf6iTaHgAPoFdJOSbw&oe=69BD4818"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pHXWS1whEH4Q7kNvwF5KFvZ&_nc_oc=AdkCW2hg0ibMPfPKLbJ2lwlLUA2ZqwcKCldOi5JdRv5hzkLTUK8fTu7eLZOdycjAF2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyGanCCFf5_SpCbPKVGWHb5tfYcHuXCMqNZtlPlW4VDxQ&oe=69BD4540"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VXup-rsp7-AQ7kNvwHPsBTg&_nc_oc=AdnlbLZPnVzaHTZbdi7uJH3V4GlBuzfKV1kUrcqOZZ383grriI3I9rNRiwIGYfBkews&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz9aok_bUA_1jkSxbcYwpu0FHnz_sbkHT3TIQsgugJB4g&oe=69BD4573"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p